    "long_instructions": "TODOs: * Choose a simple concept that you understand well, like \"how a bicycle works\" or \"what photosynthesis is.\" * Ask the AI to explain this concept to a classmate or a peer. * Next, ask the AI to explain the *same* concept, but this time to a very young child (like a 5-year-old). * Then, challenge the AI to explain the concept to a really unusual audience, like a dinosaur, a space alien, or a medieval knight. * Compare how the AI changed its language, vocabulary, and examples for each different audience. * Discuss with the bot which explanation was the most creative or surprising.",
